      "message": "Add explainer file discovery util\n\nAdd src/utils/explainers.js exporting findExplainerAstroFiles(). The function walks src/components/Projects/explainers (skipping the content/ subfolder) and collects all .astro files (any nested category), returning a map keyed by lowercased filename to the file's absolute path. This utility lives in its own module because Astro's getStaticPaths runs in an isolated scope and requires importable functions.",
